00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:08.250
I'm gonna get more self-conscious, Kelly.

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:10.650
So that's when it hits me.

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:13.020
I don't know what it's
about my personality

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:16.980
